title: "ABE"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/The-Burnes-Center/abe"
url: "https://github.com/The-Burnes-Center/abe"
authors:
  - name: "AI for Impact"
abstract: >-
  ABE is an open-source, white-label AI assistant that answers questions from
  your documents and spreadsheets, with citations. It combines an Amazon
  Bedrock Knowledge Base with structured spreadsheet indexes through an
  agentic tool loop, and deploys into your own AWS account with one CDK stack.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - chatbot
  - AWS CDK
  - Amazon Bedrock
  - open source
